</div><a class="card-module-scss-module__Vi0IrW__link" aria-label="Managed Solutions: Markets We Serve" href="/managed-solutions-markets-we-serve"></a><div class="card-module-scss-module__Vi0IrW__btn"><span>Managed Solutions: Markets We Serve</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 8 13" class=""><path fill="currentColor" d="M1.585.54 7.21 6.165a.563.563 0 0 1 0 .796l-5.625 5.625a.563.563 0 0 1-.795-.796l5.227-5.227L.79 1.336A.563.563 0 0 1 1.585.54"></path></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="card-module-scss-module__Vi0IrW__has-link cards-module-scss-module__jhX6tq__item"><div class="card-module-scss-module__Vi0IrW__item-inner"><div class="card-module-scss-module__Vi0IrW__item-holder"><h3 class="card-module-scss-module__Vi0IrW__item-heading heading4">Program Fees</h3><div class="card-module-scss-module__Vi0IrW__item-text"><p><span data-sheets-root="1">With our percentage-based fee structure, we constantly monitor the market and transact at the best prices possible for you.</span></p>
</div><a class="card-module-scss-module__Vi0IrW__link" aria-label="Managed Solutions: Fees" href="/managed-solutions-fees"></a><div class="card-module-scss-module__Vi0IrW__btn"><span>Managed Solutions: Fees</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 8 13" class=""><path fill="currentColor" d="M1.585.54 7.21 6.165a.563.563 0 0 1 0 .796l-5.625 5.625a.563.563 0 0 1-.795-.796l5.227-5.227L.79 1.336A.563.563 0 0 1 1.585.54"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="logo-bar-module-scss-module__zZStIG__wrapper light-primary" style="--marquee-duration:32s"><div class="logo-bar-module-scss-module__zZStIG__container container"><div class="logo-bar-module-scss-module__zZStIG__header"></div><div class="logo-bar-module-scss-module__zZStIG__marquee"><div class="logo-bar-module-scss-module__zZStIG__items"><div class="logo-bar-module-scss-module__zZStIG__item"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="440" height="178" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.xpansiv.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F11%2F01_XP_Dark_Helioscope.png%3Fv%3D1763503795&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.xpansiv.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F11%2F01_XP_Dark_Helioscope.png%3Fv%3D1763503795&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.xpansiv.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F11%2F01_XP_Dark_Helioscope.png%3Fv%3D1763503795&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="logo-bar-module-scss-module__zZStIG__item"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="440" height="178" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.xpansiv.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F11%2F02_XP_Dark_Enphase.png%3Fv%3D1763503795&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.xpansiv.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F11%2F02_XP_Dark_Enphase.png%3Fv%3D1763503795&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%