</div><div class="text-block-module-scss-module__VAyP-q__buttons gsap-text-block-buttons"><a class="btn btn--icon-wide text-block-module-scss-module__VAyP-q__button" href="https://www.srectrade.com/app/auth/register"><span>Sign Up Now</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="6" fill="none" class=""><path fill="currentColor" d="M16 3 11 .113v5.774zM0 3v.5h11.5v-1H0z"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div></section><section class="faqs-module-scss-module__9xlzvq__wrapper light-primary"><div class="container"><div class="faqs-module-scss-module__9xlzvq__holder"><div class="faqs-module-scss-module__9xlzvq__content"><div class="text-block-module-scss-module__VAyP-q__header"><h2 class="text-block-module-scss-module__VAyP-q__heading heading2 gsap-text-block-heading">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class="text-block-module-scss-module__VAyP-q__text body-m gsap-text-block-description"><p><span data-sheets-root="1">Answers to common questions about SREC income opportunities and program eligibility</span></p>
</div></div></div><div class="faqs-module-scss-module__9xlzvq__items"><div class="faqs-module-scss-module__9xlzvq__item faqs-module-scss-module__9xlzvq__item--active"><div class="faqs-module-scss-module__9xlzvq__item-header"><h3 class="faqs-module-scss-module__9xlzvq__item-heading ffaptosdisplay_4cb7a3de-module__KLyU8q__className heading5 bold">How do I register my solar system for SRECs?</h3><div class="faqs-module-scss-module__9xlzvq__item-icon"><span></span><span></span></div></div><div class="faqs-module-scss-module__9xlzvq__item-content gsap-faqs-item-content-0"><div class="faqs-module-scss-module__9xlzvq__item-text"><p><span data-sheets-root="1">Xpansiv handles registration end-to-end, submitting required documentation to your state’s renewable program and ensuring timely approval.</span></p>
</div></div></div><div class="faqs-module-scss-module__9xlzvq__item"><div class="faqs-module-scss-module__9xlzvq__item-header"><h3 class="faqs-module-scss-module__9xlzvq__item-heading ffaptosdisplay_4cb7a3de-module__KLyU8q__className heading5 bold">How do I receive payments for my SRECs?</h3><div class="faqs-module-scss-module__9xlzvq__item-icon"><span></span><span></span></div></div><div class="faqs-module-scss-module__9xlzvq__item-content gsap-faqs-item-content-1"><div class="faqs-module-scss-module__9xlzvq__item-text"><p><span data-sheets-root="1">Once your system generates certified RECs, our automated platform manages the sale and sends direct payments based on market price or contract terms. You also have the option of choosing when and at what price to sell your SRECs.</span></p>
</div></div></div><div class="faqs-module-scss-module__9xlzvq__item"><div class="faqs-module-scss-module__9xlzvq__item-header"><h3 class="faqs-module-scss-module__9xlzvq__item-heading ffaptosdisplay_4cb7a3de-module__KLyU8q__className heading5 bold">Can installers or developers integrate their systems with Xpansiv Managed Solutions?</h3><div class="faqs-module-scss-module__9xlzvq__item-icon"><span></span><span></span></div></div><div class="faqs-module-scss-module__9xlzvq__item-content gsap-faqs-item-content-2"><div class="faqs-module-scss-module__9xlzvq__item-text"><p>Yes. Our API and partner tools allow solar companies to register customers, track status and manage payments seamlessly through our referral program.</p>
</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class="footer-module-scss-module__wPmkna__footer"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fblocks%2Ffooter%2Fbg.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblocks%2Ffooter%2Fbg.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblocks%2Ffooter%2Fbg.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblocks%2Ffooter%2Fbg.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblocks%2Ffooter%2Fbg.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblocks%2Ffooter%2Fbg.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblocks%2Ffooter%2Fbg.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblocks%2Ffooter%2Fbg.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fblocks%2Ffooter%2Fbg.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><div class="footer-module-scss-module__wPmkna__container container body-xs"><div class="footer-module-scss-module__wPmkna__holder"><div class="footer-module-scss-module__wPmkna__left"><div class="logo-module-scss-module__UEJi4q__logo-wrapper footer-module-scss-module__wPmkna__logo gsap-logo"><a class="logo-module-scss-module__UEJi4q__logo" aria-label="Xpansiv - Home" href="/"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 138 35" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M93.8 27.021q-1.342 0-2.67-.275a24 24 0 0 1-2.394-.585q-1.068-.328-1.62-.5l.035-3.426h.904s.647.86 1.149 1.328c.548.51.887.787 1.546 1.153a6.55 6.55 0 0 0 3.223.86q1.24 0 2.119-.345t1.344-.982.465-1.514q0-.948-.62-1.584-.621-.654-1.74-1.206a39 39 0 0 0-2.619-1.153 28 28 0 0 1-2.911-1.395q-1.24-.722-1.947-1.755-.69-1.05-.69-2.72 0-1.533.983-2.686.981-1.171 2.618-1.825t3.618-.654q1.636 0 2.74.223 1.102.207 1.791.465.706.241 1.12.344l-.017 3.168h-.948s-.572-.84-1.09-1.305c-.418-.374-.786-.645-1.167-.845-.382-.2-.706-.34-1.12-.467a4.6 4.6 0 0 0-1.3