\"]},\"accordionItems\":[{\"heading\":\"Earn More Through Referrals\",\"headingTag\":[\"h3\"],\"text\":\"\u003cul\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-sheets-root=\\\"1\\\"\u003eJoin our verified partner program\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-sheets-root=\\\"1\\\"\u003eOffer SREC management as a value-add service\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-sheets-root=\\\"1\\\"\u003eEarn referral revenue while improving customer retention\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003c/ul\u003e\\n\"},{\"heading\":\"Integrate Your CRM\",\"headingTag\":[\"h3\"],\"text\":\"\u003cul\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003eUse easy API-based integration from installer platforms to Xpansiv\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003eSimplify customer onboarding and reduce data entry errors\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003eTrack registration status and SREC payments in real time\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003c/ul\u003e\\n\"},{\"heading\":\"Serve Customers Better\",\"headingTag\":[\"h3\"],\"text\":\"\u003cul\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003eProvide transparent pricing and timelines\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003eAccess educational resources and marketing materials\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003eIncrease trust with a certified, proven SREC partner\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003c/ul\u003e\\n\"}],\"image\":{\"node\":{\"altText\":\"\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://www.xpansiv.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/XP_SolarInstallers_02.jpg?v=1765398109\",\"slug\":\"xp_solarinstallers_02\",\"srcSet\":\"https://www.xpansiv.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/XP_SolarInstallers_02-300x300.jpg?v=1765398109 300w, https://www.xpansiv.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/XP_SolarInstallers_02-1024x1024.jpg?v=1765398109 1024w, https://www.xpansiv.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/XP_SolarInstallers_02-150x150.jpg?v=1765398109 150w, https://www.xpansiv.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/XP_SolarInstallers_02-768x768.jpg?v=1765398109 768w, https://www.xpansiv.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/XP_SolarInstallers_02.jpg?v=1765398109 108